{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'filed-cursors|send-request\"'!|register!|drain!|identity'\"' docs/design/dao.stream.remote.md\"","aggregated_output":"71:- **table**: composition data on a peer, `{identity {:handle h :surface\n84:kind of peer; the protocol has no peer identity at all. A peer is a channel\n95:{:dao.stream/identity        id\n107: :dao.stream/identity        id\n116: :dao.stream/identity        id\n134:- `not-found`: the identity is absent from the table, whether never served,\n135:  retired by policy, or reclaimed with its lease. An identity this peer does\n155: :dao.stream/identity  id                      ; the served logical stream\n161:that name one identity through different channels reach one stream, as the\n173:1. Look up `:dao.stream/identity` in the table. Absent: append the answer\n183:   `{:dao.stream.remote/channel <channel attachment identity>}`. The budget\n186:   `:dao.stream/identity`.\n222:On attach the link sends one `descriptor` request for the identity. Its\n238:  and `:dao.stream/identity`. Same identity as the source's own descriptor,\n324:attachment model and identity; the adapter that deposits every event as\n359:- Descriptor: `{:dao.stream/type :dao.stream/udp :dao.stream/identity\n360:  <channel identity> :dao.stream.udp/host h :dao.stream.udp/port p}`.\n370:  id. The receiver reassembles by `[channel attachment identity,\n382:- Unordered and best-effort. Attachment identity is the remote host and port\n395: :dao.stream/identity  <channel identity>\n443:attachment identity it arrived on, which for UDP is the reflexive address,\n476:identity `\"str-1\"`, complete history, surface `#{:reader}`. B's table is\n481::dao.stream/identity \"str-1\" :dao.stream/channel <B's ws descriptor>}`.\n517:  judges, the identity is the subject.\n534:`#{:writer}`, and names its identity as `:dao.lease/holder`: this is the\n554:a reclaimed identity and the reflection marks itself gone (2.4). The holder\n579:encryption hides values only; identity, ops, cursors, sizes and timing stay\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
